    "video_script": "Giorgio Chiellini's last game for Italy turned into a nightmare. In June twenty twenty-two, Argentina met Italy at Wembley in the Finalissima. Eighty thousand fans watched. Messi beat Giovanni Di Lorenzo and set up Lautaro Martínez. Ángel Di María made it two before half-time. Chiellini, in his final Italy game, was taken off at half-time. In stoppage time, Messi set up Paulo Dybala. Argentina won three-nil, six months before winning the World Cup. Was this the start of Messi's greatest year?",
